    'about.intro': 'TaleemParakh is a free student-protection project for Pakistani students applying abroad. No student pays for safety checks. We do not sell data, rankings, badges or agent listings, and we take no commission from anyone.',
    'about.whoH': 'Who runs this',
    'about.who': 'TaleemParakh is a student-protection project from Pakistan. It was started, and is run, by its founder, Saad Mirza. It is not yet a registered organisation. There are no human reviewers yet and no crisis service, so nobody here can look at your case.',
    'about.reach': 'Contact and corrections: email us. Please do not send personal documents or anyone\'s private details by email.',
    'about.reachLink': 'contact@taleemparakh.org',
    'about.doH': 'What this site does today',
    'about.do1': 'Searches official public registers (UK student sponsors, and the Australian register for overseas students, CRICOS), with the source edition date shown on every result. A listing means only what the register says it means.',
    'about.do2': 'Checks email addresses and links for lookalike and free-email tricks.',
    'about.do3': 'Scans agent messages for common scam patterns.',
    'about.do4': 'Helps you think through a payment before you make it.',
    'about.notH': 'What this site does not do',
    'about.not1': 'It does not confirm admission, scholarships, visas or agent authority. Only the institution can.',
    'about.not2': 'It does not contact universities on your behalf.',
    'about.not3': 'It does not accuse any person or agent. A warning sign is a reason to check, not proof of fraud.',
    'about.not4': 'It has no human reviewers yet and no crisis service.',
    'about.privH': 'Privacy',
    'about.priv': 'Nothing you type leaves your device. The only network requests go to this same site: the app, the guide pages (a few are saved for offline use when you first visit) and the public register file. The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which records visitor IP addresses in its server logs, as any web host does. There are no cookies and no analytics. Your language and last tab are remembered in your browser\'s local storage, and the site saves a copy of itself on your device so it can work offline. Links to official websites open those sites, which have their own rules.',
    'about.methH': 'Method and sources',
    'about.meth': 'The checks are fixed rules, not artificial intelligence: the same input always gives the same result. Every result shows its source and date. Register files come only from the documented open-data endpoints of the UK government (gov.uk content API) and the Australian government (data.gov.au). Each edition is recorded with its address, SHA-256 fingerprint and fetch time, and a very large change stops the update from being published.',
    'about.licence': 'UK data: Open Government Licence v3.0. Australian data: CC BY 2.5 AU, Department of Education.',
    'tribute.h': 'In memory of Laiba',
    'tribute.lead': 'This page is for Laiba, a bright young graduate in Pakistan who dreamed of studying abroad. We do not want any other student, or any parent, to go through this pain. If this page is hard to read, or you are in pain yourself, the help numbers are right below.',
    'tribute.helpH': 'Help you can contact',
    'tribute.helpThoughts': 'If you are having thoughts of ending your life, or of not wanting to live, please do not keep it to yourself. Talk to someone today.',
    'tribute.helpHope': 'Painful feelings can change, and talking to someone does help. Many people who felt this way found support and felt better.',
    'tribute.helpIntro': 'These public services are run by other organisations. TaleemParakh has no crisis service of its own.',
    'tribute.help1': 'In danger right now: call Rescue',
    'tribute.help1b': '(emergency services), or go to the nearest hospital emergency department, or ask someone near you to take you.',
