    'tribute.storyH': 'Laiba\'s story',
    'tribute.story1': 'Laiba was a bright young graduate who dreamed of studying abroad.',
    'tribute.story2': 'According to the Federal Investigation Agency (FIA), people pretending to be officials promised her a place at a university abroad and a scholarship. The FIA says the papers were fake. It was a fake study-abroad admission and scholarship scam. It took her family\'s savings.',
    'tribute.story3': 'The FIA has registered a case. The matter is now being adjudicated by the courts, so we do not comment on it.',
    'tribute.story4': 'Laiba is no longer with us.',
    'tribute.msgH': 'What we want every student to know',
    'tribute.msg1': 'Being scammed is never your fault. Scammers are practised at this, and they fool smart, careful people.',
    'tribute.msg2': 'Losing money is painful, but it is not your worth. There are people who can help you take the next step.',
    'tribute.msg3': 'You are not alone. Tell someone you trust today: a parent, an older brother or sister, a teacher or a friend.',
    'tribute.msg4': 'Parents: if your child tells you they were scammed, thank them for telling you. Stay calm, stay close, and do not blame them.',
    'tribute.checkH': 'Check before you pay',
    'tribute.check1': 'Stop before you pay anyone. Pressure to pay quickly is a warning sign. These free checks run on your own device:',
    'tribute.chk1': 'Check an agent\'s message',
